## Pipeline history
- G0: 2026-05-23 — drafted from Blade Forex Strategies PDF, Divergence System section

## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- Timeframe: H1 (primary). Also test H4.
- DWX symbols: **EURUSD.DWX, GBPUSD.DWX, USDJPY.DWX, AUDUSD.DWX, EURJPY.DWX**
- Swing detection: `iHighest(NULL, 0, MODE_HIGH, 11, i-5)` for swing highs (5 bars on each side). Compare swings within last 50 bars.
- MACD divergence: compare MACD Main buffer values at swing bar indices. Bullish divergence: `price_low2 < price_low1 && macd_main[low2_bar] > macd_main[low1_bar]`.
- Stochastic: `iStochastic` %K buffer divergence check, same logic.
- Minimum divergence: `abs(macd_main[peak2] - macd_main[peak1]) >= 0.0001` or expressed as % of range.
- ATR-based SL/TP: `iATR(NULL, 0, 14, 0)`.
- In P3 sweeps: try MACD-only vs Stoch-only vs dual modes.

